{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26970","headline":"酬卢汀谏议 · 姚合","name":"酬卢汀谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粟如流水帛如山，依念仓边语笑间。\n篇什纵横文案少，亲朋撩乱吏人闲。\n杯觞引满从衣湿，墙壁书多任手顽。\n遥贺来年二三月，彩衣先辈过春关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}